    "title": "Wiser - 15 minutes Audio Books",
    "description": "Wiser gives you access to the key insights from the world\u2019s best books on Productivity, Business, Negotiation, Money, Investment, Health, Love, and more!\r\n\r\n\r\nListen, and read a wide range of books designed to help you think and learn about your self-growth path and gain insight into only 15-minutes book summaries on the go.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe built Wiser with tools for you to customize your experience and learning. You can read summaries, highlight texts, change font sizes and color themes, share quotes, bookmark titles, set yourself self-learning challenges and daily goals, and build self-improvement habits into your daily routine.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Wiser app allows you to browse our growing collection of bestseller ebooks, and audiobooks, to enjoy instantly on your smartphone. Search books by author or title and read the summary to discover your next great read.\r\n\r\n\r\nCheck out Wiser\u2019s free books for \u201cDaily Read\u201d to discover your new favorite book also available as an audiobook.\r\n\r\n\r\n== Why people love Wiser ==\r\n\r\n\u2022 Listen to the audible version on the go.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Personalized recommendations based on your goals.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Beautifully designed settings for comfortable reading.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Increase your memory and analytical thinking abilities with the \u201cSpaced Repetition\u201d feature. \u2022 Browse books instantly \u2013 Read summaries and key insights while driving or at the gym. \u2022 Rate and review the books you\u2019ve read.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Read online & offline - Download books directly to your device.\r\n\r\n\r\n== Self-Improvement Starts with Wiser ==\r\n\r\nWays to become Wise(r).\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Read or listen to books that will motivate you in your self-growth journey. You can gain more insight into your life and develop a strategic vision that helps you advance in your self-learning journey by reading and listening to audiobooks.\r\n\r\n2. Consider challenging yourself with the best educational audiobooks and ebooks to improve your life personally and professionally. There\u2019s always something new to listen to and read in Wiser\u2019s digital library.\r\n\r\n3. It's always about finding a balance between Mindfulness & Motivation. We can achieve this by going through Wiser\u2019s library of bestsellers for self-growth books, health books, spirituality books, happiness and mindfulness books, and many more.\r\n\r\n4. The science of reading starts with Wiser. When you read or listen to an ebook and take notes, in a short time, you can't recall anything, does it sounds familiar? What about the best insights from the book you read last year? With Spaced Repetition feature, maximize retention and minimize learning time and boost your long-term memorization.\r\n\r\nWeb page: https://wiserapp.co/\r\nTerms of Use: https://wiserapp.co/terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://wiserapp.co/privacy",
